          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኤፌሶን ፡ ላከ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": "፲፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፰ ፤ ⟪ወበጺሖሙ ፡ ኀቤሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀሳውስትም ፡ እሱ ፡ ካለበት ፡ በደረሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጊዜ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ይቤሎሙ ፡ ለሊክሙ ፡ ተአምሩ ፡ እምአመ ፡ መጻ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኩ ፡ እስያ ፡ ዘከመ ፡ ነበርኩ ፡ ኀቤክሙ ፡ በኵሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መዋዕል ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደ ፡ እስያ ፡ ከመጣሁ ፡ ጀምሮ ፡ በዘመኑ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁሉ ፡ ከእናንተ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ እንደ ፡ ነበርሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታውቃላችሁ ፡ ም ፡ ፲፰ ፡ ፲፱ ። ፲፱ ፡ ፲ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": "፲፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፱ ፤ ⟪እንዘ ፡ እትቀነይ ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔርን ፡ ሳገለግል፡ እንደ፡ ኖርሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእሰርሕ ፡ በኵሉ ፡ ሕማም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመከራው ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ስደክም ፡ እንደ ፡ ኖር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁ ፡ ታውቃላችሁ ፡ ሐተታ ፡ ሌሊት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በስፌት ፡ ቀን ፡ በትምህርት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአንብዕ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኀዘን ፡ በልቅሶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወመንሱትኒ ፡ ዘረከበኒ ፡ እምአይሁድ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከአይሁድም ፡ ባገኘኝ ፡ መከራ ፡ ቍ ፡ ፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": "፳",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳ ፤ ⟪ወአልቦ ፡ ዘሰወርኩክሙ ፡ እምኵሉ ፡ ዘይደል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወክሙ ፡ ዘኢነገርኩክሙ ፡ ወዘኢመሀርኩክሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሚገባችሁ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ያልነገርኋችሁ ፡ ያላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስተማርኋችሁ ፡ ሰውሬ ፡ ያስቀረሁባችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የለም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": "፳፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፩ ፤ ⟪እንዘ ፡ አሰምዖሙ ፡ ለአይሁድ ፡ ክሡተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወለአረሚኒ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለአይሁድም ፡ ለአረማውያንም ፡ ገልጬ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳስተምር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በአፍአኒ ፡ ወበውሥጥኒ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይትጋነዩ ፡ ወይነስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሑ ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር ፡ ወይእመኑ ፡ በእግዚእነ ፡ ኢየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በውስጥም ፡ በአፍአም ፡ ሳስተምር ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ በውስጥ ፡ በአፍአም ፡ ለእግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሔር ፡ ይገዙ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ በጌታችን ፡ በኢየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስም ፡ ያምኑ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ሳስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተምር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፳፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፪ ፤ ⟪ወይእዜኒ ፡ ናሁ ፡ ተአሠርኩ ፡ በመንፈስየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሑር ፡ ኢየሩሳሌም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሁንም ፡ ወደ ፡ ኢየሩሳሌም ፡ ለመሄድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በልቡናዬ ፡ ተቀጥሬያለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢየአምር ፡ ዘይረክበኒ ፡ በውስቴታ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኢየሩሳሌም ፡ የሚያገኘኝን ፡ ግን፡ አላው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅም ፡ ም ፡ ፲፰ ፡ ፳፩ ። ፲፱ ፡ ፳፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": "፳፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፫ ፤ ⟪ወባሕቱ ፡ አስምዐ ፡ ሊተ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በበአህጉር ፡ እንዘ ፡ ይብል ፡ ሕማም ፡ ወመዋቅሕት፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይጸንሐከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በየሀገሩ ፡ መከራ ፡ እስራት ፡ ይቆይሃል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ አዳኝቶብኛል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንጅ ፡ ኢየአምር ፡ ላለው ፡ ም ፡ ፱ ፡ ፲፮ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፩ ፡ ፬ ፡ ፲፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": "፳፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፬ ፤ ⟪ወባሕቱ፡ ኢእሐስባ፡ ለነፍስየ፡ ወኢምንተኒ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነገር፡ ግን፡ ኢየሐስባ ፡ ምንም፡ምን፡ ለሰው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነቴ ፡ አላስብላትም ። ኢእሐስባ ፡ ይህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህ ፡ አለብሽ ፡ ብዬ ፡ ቈጥሬ ፡ አልነግራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዳዕሙ ፡ ከመ ፡ እፈጽም ፡ መልእክትየ ፡ ወእሠልጥ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግብርየ ፡ ዘነሣእኩ ፡ እምኀበ ፡ እግዚእየ ፡ ኢየሱስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ ፡ እምሀር ፡ ወእስብክ ፡ ወንጌለ ፡ ጸጋሁ ፡ ለእግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዚአብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔር ፡ በለጋስነት ፡ የሠራት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንጌልን ፡ አስተምር ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ከጌታችን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስም፡ ዘንድ ፡ የተሾምሁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለትን ፡ ሐዋርያነት ፡ እፈጽም ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ እንጅ ፡ ኢየሐስባ ፡ ም ፡ ፳፩ ፡ ፲፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
